<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations/><songwriters><songwriter>Khodi</songwriter><songwriter>Putra Haika</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="00:04:57.030"><div begin="00:00:05.060" end="00:04:57.030"><p begin="00:00:05.060" end="00:00:10.290">Semua benda aku buat</p><p begin="00:00:10.290" end="00:00:14.870">Semua benda aku buat untuk kau</p><p begin="00:00:14.870" end="00:00:25.890">Tapi sikit pun kau takleh nak cuba faham aku</p><p begin="00:00:25.890" end="00:00:28.440">Kerja 9 to 5</p><p begin="00:00:28.440" end="00:00:30.800">Honestly benda senang</p><p begin="00:00:30.800" end="00:00:33.710">Sebab i ada you</p><p begin="00:00:33.710" end="00:00:36.290">Balik kerja jumpa you</p><p begin="00:00:36.290" end="00:00:38.710">Oh tetapi</p><p begin="00:00:38.710" end="00:00:41.420">Sometimes i penat</p><p begin="00:00:41.420" end="00:00:46.400">Bagi i take five</p><p begin="00:00:46.400" end="00:00:48.330">Aku kerja 9 to 5</p><p begin="00:00:48.330" end="00:00:51.250">Aku kerja 9 to 5 untuk kau</p><p begin="00:00:51.250" end="00:00:53.800">Aku buat duit banyak gila</p><p begin="00:00:53.800" end="00:00:57.220">Memang banyak gila untuk kau</p><p begin="00:00:57.220" end="00:00:59.320">Kau nak rumah besar</p><p begin="00:00:59.320" end="00:01:01.950">Atas bukit mont kiara</p><p begin="00:01:01.950" end="00:01:08.220">Hidden hills pagar besar, sebab tu kau kena sabar</p><p begin="00:01:08.220" end="00:01:10.960">Sementara aku, uh</p><p begin="00:01:10.960" end="00:01:19.000">Sementara aku keluar cari duit untuk beli jiwa kau</p><p begin="00:01:19.000" end="00:01:21.590">Cukup bulan ku cash out</p><p begin="00:01:21.590" end="00:01:24.350">Time tu kita ball</p><p begin="00:01:24.350" end="00:01:29.880">Ball, yeah</p><p begin="00:01:29.880" end="00:01:32.390">Maybe kau just overthink</p><p begin="00:01:32.390" end="00:01:35.250">Maybe kau just overthink?</p><p begin="00:01:35.250" end="00:01:37.640">Aku tahu kau risau</p><p begin="00:01:37.640" end="00:01:42.840">Aku tahu kau risau</p><p begin="00:01:42.840" end="00:01:45.240">Semua ini untuk kau</p><p begin="00:01:45.240" end="00:01:46.640">Kau</p><p begin="00:01:46.640" end="00:01:48.080">Kau</p><p begin="00:01:48.080" end="00:01:49.340">Kau</p><p begin="00:01:49.340" end="00:01:52.010">Kerja 9 to 5</p><p begin="00:01:52.010" end="00:01:54.470">Honestly benda senang</p><p begin="00:01:54.470" end="00:01:57.220">Sebab i ada you</p><p begin="00:01:57.220" end="00:01:59.520">Balik kerja jumpa you</p><p begin="00:01:59.520" end="00:02:02.340">Oh tetapi</p><p begin="00:02:02.340" end="00:02:04.960">Sometimes i penat</p><p begin="00:02:04.960" end="00:02:10.270">Bagi i take five</p><p begin="00:02:10.270" end="00:02:12.890">Kerja 9 to 5</p><p begin="00:02:12.890" end="00:02:15.180">Honestly benda senang</p><p begin="00:02:15.180" end="00:02:17.920">Sebab i ada you</p><p begin="00:02:17.920" end="00:02:20.420">Balik kerja jumpa you</p><p begin="00:02:20.420" end="00:02:23.180">Oh tetapi</p><p begin="00:02:23.180" end="00:02:25.980">Sometimes i penat</p><p begin="00:02:25.980" end="00:02:32.110">Bagi i take five</p><p begin="00:02:32.110" end="00:02:37.200">Takda masa</p><p begin="00:02:37.200" end="00:02:42.560">Tuk beli jiwa</p><p begin="00:02:42.560" end="00:02:46.630">Jika kau ada</p><p begin="00:02:46.630" end="00:02:47.660">Kau</p><p begin="00:02:47.660" end="00:02:49.320">Kerja 9 to 5</p><p begin="00:02:49.320" end="00:02:51.750">Thinking it's alright just to waste my time</p><p begin="00:02:51.750" end="00:02:52.850">Oh my</p><p begin="00:02:52.850" end="00:02:54.680">Jangan tanya</p><p begin="00:02:54.680" end="00:02:58.070">Ku tak mahu faham lagi</p><p begin="00:02:58.070" end="00:02:59.660">Buat apa?</p><p begin="00:02:59.660" end="00:03:03.270">Ku dah kenal jiwa hati</p><p begin="00:03:03.270" end="00:03:08.760">Untuk siapa? kau cari duit untuk jadi star</p><p begin="00:03:08.760" end="00:03:12.520">Bila tanya, bag ada tapi hati tawar</p><p begin="00:03:12.520" end="00:03:15.110">Bag besar ni untuk you</p><p begin="00:03:15.110" end="00:03:17.250">Berapa kali i nak kena cakap?</p><p begin="00:03:17.250" end="00:03:19.940">Kata nak hidup susah senang?</p><p begin="00:03:19.940" end="00:03:22.380">Takkan i nak kerja pun you nak halang?</p><p begin="00:03:22.380" end="00:03:25.250">Kita patut locked in right now i'm telling you</p><p begin="00:03:25.250" end="00:03:27.690">Shouldn't play games right i'm telling you</p><p begin="00:03:27.690" end="00:03:30.420">Jangan panggil twin kalau tak faham aku</p><p begin="00:03:30.420" end="00:03:33.280">Jangan panggil twin kalau tak faham aku</p><p begin="00:03:33.280" end="00:03:34.630">No</p><p begin="00:03:34.630" end="00:03:37.380">Maybe i overthink</p><p begin="00:03:37.380" end="00:03:40.350">Just nak kau proud of me</p><p begin="00:03:40.350" end="00:03:42.530">Ku taknak sunyi lagi</p><p begin="00:03:42.530" end="00:03:47.670">Aku tahu you have dreams</p><p begin="00:03:47.670" end="00:03:50.470">Just keep your promise to me</p><p begin="00:03:50.470" end="00:03:51.850">Me</p><p begin="00:03:51.850" end="00:03:53.160">Me</p><p begin="00:03:53.160" end="00:03:54.560">Yeah</p><p begin="00:03:54.560" end="00:03:57.350">Kerja 9 to 5</p><p begin="00:03:57.350" end="00:03:59.560">Honestly benda senang</p><p begin="00:03:59.560" end="00:04:02.220">Sebab i ada you</p><p begin="00:04:02.220" end="00:04:04.790">Balik kerja jumpa you</p><p begin="00:04:04.790" end="00:04:07.530">Oh tetapi</p><p begin="00:04:07.530" end="00:04:10.150">Sometimes i penat</p><p begin="00:04:10.150" end="00:04:15.340">Bagi i take five</p><p begin="00:04:15.340" end="00:04:17.880">Kerja 9 to 5</p><p begin="00:04:17.880" end="00:04:20.130">Honestly benda senang</p><p begin="00:04:20.130" end="00:04:23.220